OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather grey start, with some
OL,6,Fpatchy light rain or drizzle and also
OL,7,Fmurky conditions over the hills.
OL,8,FTurning brighter by lunchtime with
OL,9,Fgood spells of sunshine throughout the
OL,10,Fafternoon. Feeling very warm in the
OL,11,Fsunshine for late September.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FDry with clear spells this
OL,14,Fevening, before heavy rain sweeps
OL,15,Facross the region overnight,
OL,16,Faccompanied by brisk winds for a time.
OL,17,FRemaining mild for late September.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
