OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA wet start, with difficult
OL,6,Ftravelling conditions in places. The
OL,7,Frain will clear throughout the
OL,8,Fmorning, with sunny spells and perhaps
OL,9,Fthe odd shower following. Winds also
OL,10,Feasing.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FLargely dry with sunny spells
OL,14,FThursday, before rain arrives Friday.
OL,15,FDrier and brighter Saturday once early
OL,16,Fmist and fog clears. Temperatures
OL,17,Freturning nearer to average for early
OL,18,FOctober.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
